"hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:"
1489,"Al-Rabi’ bin Sulaiman Al-Muradi narrated to us, Shuaib narrated to us, Al-Layth, H. narrated to us, Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Abdul-Hakam narrated to us, Abi and Shuaib narrated to us. They said: Al-Layth informed us, on the authority of Yazid bin Abi Habib, on the authority of Abdullah bin Abi Salamah, and Nafi’ bin Jubayr bin Mut’im, on the authority of Muadh Bin Abdul Rahman bin Uthman Al-Tamimi, on the authority of Hamran, the client of Uthman bin Affan, on the authority of Uthman bin Affan, that he said: I heard the Messenger God, may God bless him and grant him peace, says: “Whoever performs ablution and performs it well, then goes to an prescribed prayer and prays it with the imam, he will be forgiven.” ""His sin"""
